# Product specification

- Keep a single product specification at `requirements/tz.md`, in Ukrainian.
- When the user adds or changes product requirements, update that file. Do not create a second specification.
- Record anything still undecided under open questions. Do not turn it into a requirement.
- Confirmed answers replace the matching assumption or open question.
